      "sourceId": "meritbyte-pdf-24",
      "template": "DevJoke",
      "caption": "Scattered feedback creates contradictions and rework. Put comments beside the work, resolve decisions, and preserve one source of truth.\n\n#DesignReview #Collaboration #DevHumor",
