      "sourceId": "meritbyte-pdf-26",
      "template": "TechTip",
      "caption": "Unexpected indexed pages are a signal to investigate, not proof of a hack. Inspect the page, server files, redirects, logs, and search-console data.\n\n#SiteSecurity #TechnicalSEO #IncidentResponse",
      "props": {
        "eyebrow": "MeritByte — Build Better",
        "day": 7,
